--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: e9620f8c34305754d8cc9a7e49e852d9, type: 3}
  m_Name: NPC+ArthurQuest_en
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Unity.Localization::UnityEngine.Localization.Tables.StringTable
  m_LocaleId:
    m_Code: en
  m_SharedData: {fileID: 11400000, guid: fdf1f23efff172c4fbff78f565d559e3, type: 2}
  m_Metadata:
    m_Items: []
  m_TableData:
  - m_Id: 1
    m_Localized: Ahoy young man! The sea breeze is great today. Are you the new guy
      moving into the old farm?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2
    m_Localized: Caught any fresh fish today? Bring them here, I'll buy them for
      a good price!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3
    m_Localized: Smooth sailing!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4
    m_Localized: Hello. My shop sells all kinds of tools here. If you need anything
      for farming, just take a look.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5
    m_Localized: Do you need to buy a hoe, an axe, or a watering can? Choose what
      you need and bring it here to pay.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6
    m_Localized: Remember to oil them regularly, durability depends on the user.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7
    m_Localized: Good wood, hard stone. Your farm will definitely need a lot of repairs.
      I'm Mason.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8
    m_Localized: Do you need wood or boulders? I have enough materials to build a
      whole new farm.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9
    m_Localized: Just call me if you need to expand your barns.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10
    m_Localized: Hello! The weather is beautiful for planting seeds today. I'm Flora,
      nice to meet you!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11
    m_Localized: Do you want to buy wheat seeds or apple saplings? I always have
      the best ones available.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 12
    m_Localized: Remember to water them regularly!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 13
    m_Localized: Ah, you must be Richard's kid! Welcome to our little town. I'm Thomas,
      the village head.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14
    m_Localized: A thriving farm means a thriving town! If you need any advice, just
      ask the locals.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15
    m_Localized: By the way, the town is quite large. You can use the bus stations
      to travel around quickly.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 16
    m_Localized: Hello, you must be the new arrival at the farm, right? I'm Clara.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17
    m_Localized: The air in our town is always so fresh. I love taking walks around
      here.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18
    m_Localized: If you have some free time, you should walk around town and get
      to know everyone.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19
    m_Localized: Hello. I am Dr. Victor. I oversee the health of everyone in this
      town.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 20
    m_Localized: Farming is physically demanding. Make sure you don't overexert yourself
      and pass out in the fields.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 21
    m_Localized: If you ever feel unwell, come see me immediately.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22
    m_Localized: What do you want? Go away, I have nothing for you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 23
    m_Localized: City kids like you shouldn't be wandering around here. Go back to
      your shiny farm.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 24
    m_Localized: Stop bothering me. Mind your own business, kid.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 25
    m_Localized: Oh, Richard's child! It's so good to see you returning to the farm.
      I'm Martha.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 26
    m_Localized: Have you seen my boy, Oliver? He is always running around somewhere...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 27
    m_Localized: If you ever get hungry from all that farm work, come by. I bake
      fresh bread every morning.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28
    m_Localized: Wow, you're the new farmer! I'm Oliver. Do you have any cool animals?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 29
    m_Localized: Mom tells me not to go near the forest, but I want to explore it!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 30
    m_Localized: When you're not busy digging dirt, let's play together!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 31
    m_Localized: Hello, you are Richard's son, right?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 34
    m_Localized: The trip from the city must have been exhausting. Your father's
      farm is a bit far from here.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 35
    m_Localized: Go to the bus station over there and take it to the farm. I will
      head back first and wait for you there.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 36
    m_Localized: The bus station is right over there. Just get on and select the
      Farm as your destination.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 37
    m_Localized: You made it. Welcome home.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 38
    m_Localized: Now that you're here, we should get straight to business.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 39
    m_Localized: Your father, Richard, left some old farming tools for you in a chest
      in the warehouse on the right.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 40
    m_Localized: Head over there, open the chest and take them. You will need them
      to clear this overgrown field.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41
    m_Localized: The chest is right inside the warehouse on the right. Go get your
      tools so you can start working.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 42
    m_Localized: Excellent. With those tools, you can start breathing life back into
      this farm.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43
    m_Localized: Now that you have the tools and the wheat seeds I gave you, let's
      put them to use.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 44
    m_Localized: Try tilling the soil and planting 10 wheat seeds on your field.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 45
    m_Localized: Use your hoe to till the ground, then plant 10 wheat seeds.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 46
    m_Localized: Great job! You're a natural at this, just like your father.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 47
    m_Localized: The farm is looking better, but the garden is still quite a mess.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48
    m_Localized: Just gather up the scattered branches and stones around the garden.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 49
    m_Localized: Keep picking up the branches and stones. A clean field is the first
      step to a successful harvest.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 50
    m_Localized: Excellent work. The place is finally starting to look like a real
      farm again.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51
    m_Localized: Farming takes patience. Now that the seeds are planted, they need
      time to grow.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 52
    m_Localized: Wait for the wheat to ripen, then harvest them.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 53
    m_Localized: Just be patient and wait for the wheat to ripen, then harvest them.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 54
    m_Localized: A wonderful first harvest! You are really getting the hang of this.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 55
    m_Localized: As a reward for your harvest, here are some fruit tree seeds.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 56
    m_Localized: Go ahead and plant them in the garden.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57
    m_Localized: Go ahead and plant those fruit tree seeds.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 58
    m_Localized: Great. Fruit trees take a while to grow, but they are worth the
      wait.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 59
    m_Localized: Fruit trees take much longer to grow than wheat. You will need to
      be patient.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 60
    m_Localized: Wait until the apple trees mature to harvest the apples. Also, use
      your axe to chop down the trees to collect wood.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 61
    m_Localized: Just wait for the trees to grow, then harvest the apples and use
      your axe to chop wood.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 62
    m_Localized: Perfect. Now we have fresh apples and enough wood for future work.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 63
    m_Localized: Here is some stone for your hard work. Now that we have enough wood
      and stone, let's upgrade the garden.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 64
    m_Localized: Head over to the Workshop to upgrade and expand the garden area.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 65
    m_Localized: Take your wood and stone to the Workshop to upgrade the garden.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 66
    m_Localized: Look at that! The garden is much more spacious now. We can plant
      a lot more here.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 67
    m_Localized: Now that the farm is bigger, you will need money to buy more seeds
      and supplies.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 68
    m_Localized: Try taking some of your harvested wheat or apples to sell.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 69
    m_Localized: Take the items you want to sell to the merchant.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 70
    m_Localized: Good job. Earning money is an essential part of running this farm.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 71
    m_Localized: You did well with your first sale. Here, take this watering can.
      You will need it from now on.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 72
    m_Localized: Watering and using fertilizer will reduce the growing time of your
      crops. Head over to the old well and unlock it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73
    m_Localized: Go unlock it, because when your watering can runs out, you will
      need the well to draw more water.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74
    m_Localized: Perfect. Now you can use the well to get water.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 75
    m_Localized: Here, take this fishing rod. It's always good to have other ways
      to gather food and materials.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76
    m_Localized: Head over to the water and try catching 5 fish.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 77
    m_Localized: Use your fishing rod to catch 5 fish. Be patient!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 78
    m_Localized: Great catch! Fishing is a wonderful way to pass the time while waiting
      for crops to grow.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 79
    m_Localized: You have learned the basics of farming, gathering, and fishing.
      Now it's time to prepare for livestock.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 80
    m_Localized: Go and unlock the animal barn. We need a proper place for them to
      stay.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 81
    m_Localized: Head over and unlock the animal barn.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 82
    m_Localized: You did it! The barn is ready for the animals, but we still need
      to set up a few more things before they arrive.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95
    m_Localized: To finish the preparations, you need to build a feeding trough for
      the animals.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 96
    m_Localized: If you don't, the animals will eat the crops in your garden. Also,
      you should build fences to keep them from wandering around.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 97
    m_Localized: Go build a feeding trough to protect your crops. And remember, fences
      will keep the animals from wandering around.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 98
    m_Localized: Excellent work! Your farm is now safe and truly complete. I will
      take my leave now. Good luck!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 240
    m_Localized: Hello there! Oh, perfect timing. Do you happen to have any radishes
      growing on your farm?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 241
    m_Localized: I'm making my special stew today, but the ones at the market are
      all wilted. If you have some, could you spare a few fresh ones?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 242
    m_Localized: Still waiting on those radishes! The stew pot is already boiling.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 243
    m_Localized: Oh, these are so crisp and fresh! Thank you so much. Here, take
      this for your hard work.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 247
    m_Localized: Oh, hello again! That stew was delicious. You wouldn't happen to
      be growing potatoes too, would you?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 248
    m_Localized: I'm thinking of making baked potatoes for dinner. If you harvest
      any, could you bring some over?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 249
    m_Localized: Still haven't found any good potatoes yet. Take your time, there's
      no rush today.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 250
    m_Localized: Look at these! Big and firm. Your farm soil must be magical. Thanks
      again!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 254
    m_Localized: Hello again! Say, do you happen to have any mango trees on your
      farm?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 255
    m_Localized: I'm craving something sweet for dessert today. If you harvest any
      ripe mangoes, could you bring a few over?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 256
    m_Localized: No rush on those mangoes. Just bring them over whenever they're
      ready.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 257
    m_Localized: Oh, these smell amazing! Perfectly ripe. Thank you so much!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  references:
    version: 2
    RefIds: []
